  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.146,
      "end": 2.548,
      "text": "Along the ocean floor's volcanic fissures,"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.548,
      "end": 5.096,
      "text": "hydrothermal vents spew mineral-dense fluids"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.096,
      "end": 7.426,
      "text": "at temperatures exceeding four hundred degrees Celsius."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.426,
      "end": 9.828,
      "text": "In this pitch-black abyss, survival seems impossible."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.828,
      "end": 12.522,
      "text": "Yet, life thrives. Specialized bacteria perform chemosynthesis,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.522,
      "end": 14.924,
      "text": "converting toxic hydrogen sulfide into organic energy"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.924,
      "end": 17.108,
      "text": "without a single ray of sunlight."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.108,
      "end": 19.656,
      "text": "This chemical engine powers an entire deep-sea food web,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.656,
      "end": 21.84,
      "text": "proving that life can flourish in extreme environments."
    }
  ],
